        "fact_status": "original synthetic teaching API contract; not a real SDK or upstream documentation",
        "text": "# Synthetic Aster developer API version two\n\n## Create a copy\n\nIn this separate synthetic API version, call create_copy(name, content) to create a document.\n\nThis version's conflict response uses a different teaching contract. Never substitute its paragraphs for version one instructions.\n\n## List documents\n\nCall names() to list the documents in this synthetic version.\n",
